# Traderbot core

- **Bar semantics**: Strategies implement `Algorithm.on_bar` with only data up to the current bar close. No lookahead, no future bars in features or signals.
- **Reuse**: Indicator math lives in `traderbot/ml/features.py`, `traderbot/algorithms/bands.py`, `traderbot/algorithms/streaming.py`. Do not duplicate RSI/MACD/ATR/Bollinger logic in strategies.
- **ML holdout**: Training/eval uses time splits and horizon embargo (`tests/test_holdout_and_models.py`, README). New features must stay causal at time `t`.
- **CLI**: User-facing entry points include `traderbot strategy`, `traderbot ml`, `traderbot data`, `traderbot pipeline`. Register new strategies in `traderbot/algorithms/registry.py`.
- **Changes**: Small, focused diffs; match existing naming and tests under `tests/`. Run `pytest` for touched areas.
